cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "LipidoX: a web platform for LC-MS/MS lipidomics data processing, statistical analysis and visualization"
abstract: "LipidoX is a self-hosted web platform for LC-MS/MS lipidomics data processing, statistical analysis and interactive visualization. The repository contains the platform source code and two demonstration datasets built from the same 90 human plasma samples: a 223-feature panel used in the manuscript analysis and an extended 341-feature panel for the LipidSigR-backed enrichment and network modules."
